<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenian bakery Kruh-Pecivo to list on OTC.</title>
<headline>Slovenian bakery Kruh-Pecivo to list on OTC.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovenian bakery Kruh-Pecivo will list its shares on the over-the-counter (OTC) section of the Ljubljana Stock Exchange on July 2, the bourse said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The company will list 425,126 ordinary shares, with a nominal value of 1,000 tolars ($6.39) each, representing 65 percent of its total equity.</p>
<p>Kruh-Pecivo becomes the 31st company to be floated on the main or OTC sections of the Ljubljana bourse since the beginning of last year.</p>
<p>At the momment there are 29 issues traded on the main and 41 on the OTC market.</p>
<p>-- Novica Mihajlovic, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
